  "body": "Less housework, more beach time!\r\n\r\nFeatures and Benefits\r\n* Two double bedrooms, one bathroom\r\n* Single carport\r\n* Walk to Castor Bay Beach and Good Hood Eatery\r\n* Beautifully renovated\r\n* Open plan kitchen/dining\r\n* Brick and weatherboard exterior\r\n* Zoned for double Westlake, Wairau Intermediate, Campbells Bay Primary\r\n* Proximity to Milford Beach, local shops and cafes, Milford Mall, boutique shops, cafes and restaurants, public transport, medical facilities and motorway access.\r\n\r\nLet's face it. Life's too short to spend all weekend tending large gardens, doing hours of upkeep and housework; wouldn't you rather be at the beach?\r\n\r\nWelcome to 1/45 Castor Bay Road. With a view that never grows old, a beautifully renovated brick and weatherboard home that lets you spend more time living and less time working.\r\n\r\nInside, it's fresh and stylish. The modern open-plan kitchen and dining area is perfect for everyday living and entertaining. \r\nThere are two generous double bedrooms, a lovely modern bathroom and a single carport. Everything you need, without a whole lot of stuff you don't.\r\n\r\nWith Castor Bay and Milford Beach on your doorstep, it's perfect for a morning stroll or a relaxing afternoon by the water, restaurants, shops, supermarkets and all the good things Milford has to offer.  For those wanting the ultimate in education, this home offers just that being zoned for Westlake Boys and Girls, as well as Campbells Bay School.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer looking to step onto the property ladder, a professional couple seeking a stylish and easy-care home, or someone looking to downsize without compromising on location, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nSometimes the smartest move is the simplest one.\r\n\r\nCall Team Roberts and come see what all the fuss is about.\r\n\r\nTo view property files, please click on this link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/32LP",
